<title>HONG KONG: Trading in South Sea Dev suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in South Sea Dev suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of South Sea Development Co Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$0.46 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6352</p>
